OL,3,CBaton of Hope returning to Birmingham
OL,4,Cto challenge suicide 'stigma'
OL,6,FThe Baton of Hope will once again
OL,7,Freturn to Birmingham in 2027, as part
OL,8,Fof a UK-wide initiative aiming to
OL,9,Fraise awareness and encourage more
OL,10,Fopen conversations about suicide,
OL,11,Fbringing together communities and
OL,12,Findividuals to challenge stigma.
OL,14,FBaton of Hope first came to Birmingham
OL,15,Fin 2023, when people from the city and
OL,16,Facross the West Midlands came together
OL,17,Fto carry the Baton.
OL,19,FIn 2024, 89 people in Birmingham died
OL,20,Fby suicide.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/5
