OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1787077108
OL,3,CBaton of Hope returning to Birmingham
OL,4,Cto challenge suicide 'stigma'
OL,6,FOrganiser say they want to take what
OL,7,Fthe Baton represents beyond services
OL,8,Fand into communities - to encourage
OL,9,Fpeople to talk about suicide,
OL,10,Frecognise when someone may be
OL,11,Fstruggling and know where to turn for
OL,12,Fhelp.
OL,14,F"Every life lost to suicide is a
OL,15,Ftragedy"
OL,17,FCouncillor Nosheen Khalid, Cabinet
OL,18,FMember for Health and Social Care at
OL,19,FBirmingham City Council, said:
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
