OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,344,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1787077108
OL,3,CBaton of Hope returning to Birmingham
OL,4,Cto challenge suicide 'stigma'
OL,6,F"We're delighted that the Baton of
OL,7,FHope is returning to Birmingham in
OL,8,F2027, but this is about much more than
OL,9,Fwelcoming an event back into our city.
OL,11,F"Every life lost to suicide is a
OL,12,Ftragedy, and behind every statistic is
OL,13,Fa family, a friendship group, a
OL,14,Fworkplace and community left dealing
OL,15,Fwith the consequences.
OL,17,F"The Baton of Hope gives us a very
OL,18,Fvisible way of saying that suicide
OL,19,Fprevention matters, and that none of
OL,20,Fus should be afraid of talking about
OL,21,Fit.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/5
