FL,344,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1787077108
OL,3,CBaton of Hope returning to Birmingham
OL,4,Cto challenge suicide 'stigma'
OL,6,F"The Baton's return provides the
OL,7,Fregion with an opportunity to come
OL,8,Ftogether, remember those we have lost,
OL,9,Fsupport those who are struggling and,
OL,10,Fmost importantly, encourage
OL,11,Fconversations that could help someone
OL,12,Fget through a difficult moment."
OL,14,FThe Baton of Hope was created as a
OL,15,Fsymbol of suicide prevention and has
OL,16,Ftravelled across the UK since its
OL,17,Finaugural tour in 2023, and a second
OL,18,Ftour in 2025.
OL,26,@tD@`O]
