OL,3,CBaton of Hope returning to Birmingham
OL,4,Cto challenge suicide 'stigma'
OL,6,FThe 2027 edition will visit 20
OL,7,Flocations across the UK, including
OL,8,Fcities such as Nottingham,
OL,9,FLincolnshire, and Doncaster.
OL,11,FFurther details about the Birmingham
OL,12,Froute, events, Baton bearers and
OL,13,Fopportunities for local organisations
OL,14,Fand communities to get involved will
OL,15,Fbe announced in due course.
OL,17,FIf you need support, the following
OL,18,Fservices are available:
